{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../unicodeencodeerror-codec-cant-encode/", "title": "UnicodeEncodeError: \u2018\u2026\u2019 codec can\u2019t encode \u2026"}, "next": {"link": "../sqlite3-operationalerror-database-is-locked/", "title": "sqlite3.OperationalError: database is locked"}, "title": "Uploading with URLs gives error WEBPAGE_CURL_FAILED", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"uploading-with-urls-gives-error-webpage-curl-failed\">\n<h1>Uploading with URLs gives error WEBPAGE_CURL_FAILED<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#uploading-with-urls-gives-error-webpage-curl-failed\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>When uploading media files using an URL, the server automatically tries to download the media and uploads it to the\nTelegram cloud. This error usually happens in case the provided URL is not publicly accessible by Telegram itself or the\nmedia file is too large. In such cases, your only option is to download the media yourself and upload it from your\nlocal machine.</p>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/sqlite3-operationalerror-database-is-locked", "sqlite3.OperationalError: database is locked", "N", "next"], ["faq/unicodeencodeerror-codec-cant-encode", "UnicodeEncodeError: \u2018\u2026\u2019 codec can\u2019t encode \u2026", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Uploading with URLs gives error WEBPAGE_CURL_FAILED</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/uploading-with-urls-gives-error-webpage-curl-failed", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}